          "tex": "\ns_i(\\theta)=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\theta}\\log f(X_i\\mid\\theta),\n\\qquad\nh_i(\\theta)=-\\frac{\\partial^2}{\\partial\\theta^2}\\log f(X_i\\mid\\theta).\n",
